  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186204089,
      "id": "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4",
      "title": "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "21359e31-00e1-56e1-9009-7bb8c2b0ebfa",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nI. $-4x-3=-4x-4$\n\nII. $-7x-5=-7x+1$\n\nIII. $-9x+5=7x-6$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4x-3 & =-4x-4 \\\\ -4x-3+4x & =-4x-4+4x \\\\ -3 & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $x.$ Therefore, the equation $-4x-3=-4x-4$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-7x-5 & =-7x+1 \\\\ -7x-5+7x & =-7x+1+7x \\\\ -5 & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $x.$ Therefore, the equation $-7x-5=-7x+1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9x+5 & =7x-6 \\\\ -9x+5-7x-5 & =7x-6-7x-5 \\\\ -16x & =-11 \\\\ x & =\\frac{11}{16}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $-9x+5=7x-6$ has the unique solution $x=\\frac{11}{16}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "044e1f99-c09b-55c9-801d-37d283f49c83",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "7d38f2c2-3a8f-5829-8000-ed4eb5a6c5c7",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4f28319c-9007-5c3e-a0cb-57b2fa7b981a",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3335408c-8a5b-5880-bd5f-682e03be8a65",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I, II, and III"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4aeffb06-ba9d-5ee2-acf0-d6727abc2b68",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "dc4e1ef9-c444-5c6b-be8b-59c871ab025d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "4aeffb06-ba9d-5ee2-acf0-d6727abc2b68"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
